        <h1><a href="/">The Baseball Chronicle</a></h1>
        <h2><span class="entryprev"><a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/essays/response_to_bill_james" title="Previous story">&#8592;</a></span> <a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/fiction/">Fiction</a>, August 2009 <span class="entrynext"><a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/pujols_through_the_ages" title="Next story">&#8594;</a></span</h2>
    </div>
